# 使用说明 / Usage
# 1. 复制本文件为 cookie.txt  (copy this file to cookie.txt)
# 2. 浏览器登录 weibo.com，打开开发者工具 -> Network -> 复制任意请求的 Cookie 值
#    (log in to weibo.com, open DevTools -> Network -> copy the Cookie header)
# 3. 将 Cookie 值粘贴到 cookie.txt（一行，去掉本说明）
#    (paste the cookie value into cookie.txt on one line)

YOUR_WEIBO_COOKIE_HERE
